WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.601 --> 00:00:03.167
-Did you guys see the picture of
French President Emmanuel Macron

00:00:03.167 --> 00:00:04.601
that was going around yesterday?

00:00:04.601 --> 00:00:06.767
It went viral because his shirt
is unbuttoned

00:00:06.767 --> 00:00:08.434
and he's showing
a lot of chest hair.

00:00:08.434 --> 00:00:10.100
Here it is.
Here it is right -- Yeah.

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:12.634
[ Audience laughs, oohs ]

00:00:12.634 --> 00:00:15.133
Well, Macron is running for
re-election right now

00:00:15.133 --> 00:00:17.167
and he actually asked us
if he could premiere

00:00:17.167 --> 00:00:19.868
a new campaign song
on our show tonight.

00:00:19.868 --> 00:00:21.534
So ladies and gentlemen,

00:00:21.534 --> 00:00:24.701
please welcome French President
Emmanuel Macron.

00:00:24.701 --> 00:00:25.868
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:25.868 --> 00:00:31.834
♪♪

00:00:31.834 --> 00:00:37.834
♪♪

00:00:37.834 --> 00:00:40.467
♪ [ French accent ]
Bonjour, it is me ♪

00:00:40.467 --> 00:00:42.968
♪ With my chest hair, you see ♪

00:00:42.968 --> 00:00:45.534
♪ Do you think I'm sexy? ♪

00:00:45.534 --> 00:00:49.133
♪ I sure hope you say oui ♪

00:00:49.133 --> 00:00:54.067
♪ I have good policies
for ze economy ♪

00:00:54.067 --> 00:00:58.701
♪ I shall make my VP
Emily in Paris ♪

00:00:58.701 --> 00:01:00.434
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.434 --> 00:01:02.501
♪ I'm as French as can be ♪

00:01:02.501 --> 00:01:05.067
♪ I can get you in free ♪

00:01:05.067 --> 00:01:07.567
♪ To ze patisserie ♪

00:01:07.567 --> 00:01:10.033
♪ The chef is ratatouille ♪

00:01:10.033 --> 00:01:14.567
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.567 --> 00:01:20.634
♪ We can nibble ze brie,
smoke a cig by the sea ♪

00:01:20.634 --> 00:01:25.734
♪ Give my chest hair a squeeze
as it blows in ze breeze ♪

00:01:25.734 --> 00:01:32.100
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:36.000
♪ Now I must say adieu ♪

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:38.834
♪ But in 2022 ♪

00:01:38.834 --> 00:01:41.367
♪ If you all vote for me ♪

00:01:41.367 --> 00:01:44.734
♪ I will whisper merci ♪

00:01:44.734 --> 00:01:49.100
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:49.100 --> 00:01:56.534
♪ But for now I bid you
adieu, adieu, adieu ♪

00:01:56.534 --> 00:01:58.334
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:58.334 --> 00:02:01.868
We have a great show tonight!

00:02:01.868 --> 00:02:04.934
Marlon Wayans is here!

00:02:04.934 --> 00:02:07.868
Natasha Lyonne is here.

00:02:07.868 --> 00:02:11.467
And we got music
from Dove Cameron.

00:02:11.467 --> 00:02:14.534
We are playing "True
Confessions" when we come back.

00:02:14.534 --> 00:02:16.634
Stick around, everyone.

00:02:16.634 --> 00:02:22.634
♪♪

